{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/0e007096f63f45a00ec6bdb4f38ec41b.poster.avif?t=1761422880\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/0e007096f63f45a00ec6bdb4f38ec41b.webm?t=1761422880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/0e007096f63f45a00ec6bdb4f38ec41b.mp4?t=1761422880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can you expect from this adventure?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong>: Face false gods that are both prisoners and jailers. Uncover their stories and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >break their chains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Souls-like Progression</strong>: Learn from every death as you grow stronger, guided by Bastet.\u00a0Use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your trusted sword, Daedalus to gather stardust and grow in power! The more you parry, the</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >stronger Daedalus becomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/01b9e76ea086f2c48b2100cffd6f3146.poster.avif?t=1761422880\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/01b9e76ea086f2c48b2100cffd6f3146.webm?t=1761422880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/01b9e76ea086f2c48b2100cffd6f3146.mp4?t=1761422880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore-Rich World</strong>: Uncover hidden truths in cryptic murals, echoing voices, and twisted mazes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Platformer</strong>: Precision-based movements, where you have to use Icarus' Wings to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your advantage!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the trials and discover the truth about the origins, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or will you fall to the shadows lurking in the desert\u00a0and\u00a0beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/db078ab80d9e1b8388659ee2448beb6f.poster.avif?t=1761422880\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/db078ab80d9e1b8388659ee2448beb6f.webm?t=1761422880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/db078ab80d9e1b8388659ee2448beb6f.mp4?t=1761422880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attributions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Music used in promotional materials and in-game are attributed to:\u00a0Leonard.B.Blaesing,\u00a0klankbeeld,\u00a0SoundFlakes or\u00a0frankum, who you can find on the freesound web platform!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891970?t=1761422880","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891970?t=1761422880","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/3a987a1d113305e4ea92ae7049838d6e8d4f28d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761422880","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/3a987a1d113305e4ea92ae7049838d6e8d4f28d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761422880","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"de